<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer | Hustle & Rise" description="Important limitations covering Hustle & Rise career, job, training, side-hustle, money, and third-party information.">
  <section class="legal-page px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8"><article class="prose prose-lg mx-auto max-w-4xl prose-headings:font-brand prose-headings:font-extrabold prose-headings:text-[#172033] prose-p:text-[#566071] prose-p:leading-8 prose-li:text-[#566071]"><p class="section-eyebrow">Trust & transparency</p><h1>Disclaimer</h1><p><strong>Last updated: 16 August 2026</strong></p><h2>General information</h2><p>Hustle & Rise provides general educational information. It is not personalised career, legal, financial, immigration, tax, health, or professional advice. Consider your circumstances and seek a qualified adviser when a decision requires professional guidance.</p><h2>Job listings</h2><p>Listings come from identified third-party sources. Employers and source platforms control their accuracy, availability, requirements, and application process. Always verify the original listing before applying or sharing personal information. Hustle & Rise does not guarantee employment or act as the employer.</p><h2>Training</h2><p>Planned or upcoming classes are clearly labelled. Dates, prices, instructors, delivery details, and outcomes are not confirmed until explicitly published. Expressing interest does not guarantee a place.</p><h2>Earning and money content</h2><p>Examples are educational and do not promise income or results. Earnings depend on skill, demand, time, costs, tax obligations, and individual circumstances. Never spend money solely because of an illustrative example.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>External websites operate under their own terms and privacy practices. A link does not automatically mean that Hustle & Rise endorses every claim, service, or policy on that website.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Report a correction or concern through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p></article></section>
